---
import SubpageLayout from '../../../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---

<SubpageLayout title="Accommodation" description="Where to stay, how to plan early and what to expect from limited availability." sectionEmoji="🏨" sectionLabel="Ekai" includeTopBar={true} includeFooter={true} locale="na">
  <p>Accommodation on Nauru is limited, so planning early matters more than comparing lots of options. If you are travelling for work, research or a short visit, reserve first and refine later.</p>
<div class="callout-grid">
  <div class="callout"><h3>Book early</h3><p>Availability can change quickly.</p></div>
  <div class="callout"><h3>Check location</h3><p>Short distances still affect convenience.</p></div>
  <div class="callout"><h3>Confirm inclusions</h3><p>Meals, pickup and Wi-Fi can vary.</p></div>
  <div class="callout"><h3>Have a backup</h3><p>A second option is useful in a small market.</p></div>
</div>
<h2>What to ask</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Is the room available for all dates?</li>
  <li>Are airport transfers included?</li>
  <li>What payment methods are accepted?</li>
  <li>Is Wi-Fi or meal service available?</li>
</ul>

<h2>Next pages</h2>
<div class="utility-grid">
  <a href="/na/visit/visa/" class="utility-card"><h3>🛂 Visa</h3><p>Entry requirements and documentation.</p></a>
  <a href="/na/visit/transport/" class="utility-card"><h3>🚢 Transport</h3><p>Airport transfers and island travel.</p></a>
  <a href="/na/visit/currency/" class="utility-card"><h3>💵 Currency</h3><p>Payment methods and cash planning.</p></a>
  <a href="/na/visit/" class="utility-card"><h3>🗺️ Visit hub</h3><p>Back to the travel guide.</p></a>
</div>
</SubpageLayout>

<style>
  .utility-grid,.link-grid,.callout-grid,.contact-grid{display:grid;gap:16px;margin:1rem 0 2rem}
  .utility-grid,.link-grid,.callout-grid,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .utility-card,.callout,.contact-card,.link-grid a{border:2px solid #1a1a2e;background:#fff;padding:18px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #1a1a2e;display:block}
  .utility-card h3,.callout h3,.contact-card h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#002B7F}
  
  @media (max-width: 720px){.utility-grid,.link-grid,.callout-grid,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
